                                                                                
 Usage: opentide lint [OPTIONS]                                                 
                                                                                
 Check file names and recommended metadata                                      
                                                                                
 Catalogue hygiene: filename slugs and recommended metadata, not schema         
 validation.                                                                    
 A missing optional field is a note: it never fails --strict, and prints with   
 --verbose.                                                                     
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --fix                                      Apply safe filename renames       │
│ --strict                                   Exit non-zero when errors or      │
│                                            warnings are left (CI gate).      │
│                                            Notes never fail it               │
│ --check          CHECK                     Limit to one check: filenames,    │
│                                            metadata, recommended,            │
│                                            placeholders or queries           │
│                                            (repeatable). Runs it even when   │
│                                            lint.toml disables it             │
│ --changed                                  Lint only the object files this   │
│                                            run changed: the pull or merge    │
│                                            request, the push, or outside CI  │
│                                            the last commit (the diff deploy  │
│                                            reads)                            │
│ --file           <str>                     Lint only this object file        │
│                                            (repeatable)                      │
│ --format         <text|sarif|codequality>  text: code frames. sarif: SARIF   │
│                                            2.1.0 for code scanning.          │
│                                            codequality: GitLab Code Quality  │
│                                            (Code Climate JSON). A report     │
│                                            goes to --output, or to stdout    │
│                                            instead of the text               │
│                                            [default: text]                   │
│ --output         <path>                    Write the --format report to this │
│                                            file and print the usual text     │
│                                            output too                        │
│ --help                                     Show this message and exit.       │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide lint
   $ opentide lint --fix
